00:21:04,960 --> 00:21:13,920
 understand how docker volumes work. Before we end this lecture let's discuss primary uses of docker

108
00:21:13,920 --> 00:21:25,840
 volumes. First is the data persistence of files that contain some important data. Second is database

109
00:21:25,840 --> 00:21:34,480
 management. We can store database files so they will be saved outside the container and this way

